 "remarks": "Available September 1st! This beautifully maintained 4-bedroom, 2-bath ranch offers the ease of one-level living in one of Westport's most desirable locations. Freshly updated with brand-new carpeting in the bedrooms, a new washer and dryer, and a newly finished sunroom, this move-in-ready home provides flexible living space perfect for a home office, gym, playroom, or additional sitting area.  Situated on a quiet private street, the property features ample off-street parking, a spacious yard ideal for relaxing or entertaining, and generous storage with both a large attic and outdoor shed. The versatile floor plan offers flexibility for a fourth bedroom, guest space, or work-from-home needs.  Enjoy the best of Westport living with Compo Beach just a short walk away and downtown Westport, shopping, dining, parks, and the train station only minutes from your doorstep. Updated appliances and thoughtful improvements throughout make this an exceptional rental opportunity.  Available September 1, 2026. Security deposit and credit check required.",
